      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 960,
        "name": "树莓",
        "desc": "颜色鲜艳的果实。遍布野外的小小美好，能将路途疲惫一扫而空。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Berry_icon.png",
        "amount": 3,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1104,
        "name": "牛奶",
        "desc": "奶牛的乳汁。香香甜甜，嘴角的那滴也不想放过。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Milk_icon.png",
        "amount": 3,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1048,
        "name": "清心",
        "desc": "只生长在孤高石峰的通透白花。不愿接受平原的温暖与湿润，宁可在清冷的尖峰眺望远方。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Qingxin_icon.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1328,
        "name": "糖",
        "desc": "提炼自甜甜花的调味剂。它的甜味仿佛有着与人共鸣的力量，能够驱散内心的阴霾。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Sugar_icon.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关料理"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4244,
        "name": "果果仙酪",
        "desc": "<p>色彩素净的饮品。融合了果味的酸奶制成冰沙，铺成蓝天白云的模样，底部垫着的是厚厚的一层果丁与晶冻。清爽的味道，正是消暑的好选择。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/12/88072335/9e0d91cc6a5fa73b7076e2e53ad3e8dd_2497242352755428458.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4245,
        "name": "奇怪的果果仙酪",
        "desc": "<p>色彩素净的饮品。冷过头的冰沙，给人一种在龙脊雪山攀登的错觉。在极寒的环境下，严寒积蓄到了顶点…还是赶快找个篝火烤烤火吧！</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/12/88072335/09985501a622784d665bc0d282eeabf6_6985401948658392265.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4243,
        "name": "美味的果果仙酪",
        "desc": "<p>色彩素净的饮品。清新的冰沙，隐隐约约带着几丝缥缈的果味，让人忍不住联想：庆云顶上仙气飘飘的云朵，尝起来是不是这种曼妙滋味？</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/12/88072335/e028880153e5190b845b80647cacf9b9_2463797826008400131.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "日落莓莓茶"
