      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2797,
        "name": "墩墩桃",
        "desc": "<p>林中灌木结出的果实。肉质敦实，味道香甜可口。据说食用后还有宁心安神的功效。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/09/18/47826599/cc66085ba88fdb28bb907431cbb55cef_5034711764633517371.png",
        "amount": 2,
