      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 883,
        "name": "日落果",
        "desc": "遍布提瓦特大陆的自然恩惠，如夕阳般靓丽美好的饱满果实。有着奇异的香甜气味，能让人精神百倍。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Sunsettia_icon.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1503,
        "name": "苹果",
        "desc": "爽脆可口的酸甜果实，无论生食或是酿酒都很是美味。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Apple_icon.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 960,
        "name": "树莓",
        "desc": "颜色鲜艳的果实。遍布野外的小小美好，能将路途疲惫一扫而空。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Berry_icon.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关料理"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7818,
        "name": "九果甘露饮",
        "desc": "多种果汁混合而成的饮料。按照特定比例将各类果汁均匀混合，使得众多水果风味互相交织，保持了酸酸甜甜的好味道，加入冰块更显美味。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/06/16/8c93c3c9493b579e24edd73b5edb5aea_2386706363287281045.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7817,
        "name": "奇怪的九果甘露饮",
        "desc": "多种果汁混合而成的饮料。又酸又苦…怎么甚至还带点咸？唯独少了期待中的甜味，这复杂的味道…难道制作过程中不小心混入了未知的草药汤？",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/06/16/cb3d73d9f2fde1383fee759ff5ecc486_321002714058705651.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7819,
        "name": "美味的九果甘露饮",
        "desc": "多种果汁混合而成的饮料。一口入喉，仿佛身体被阳光下的水果篮稳稳接住，自然清甜的香气在鼻尖飘过，每一口都是缤纷果香的完美融合。热浪来袭时喝上一杯，说是灵魂的救赎也不为过！",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/06/16/b36e79e281c916a59db1e22906afd8a1_7918070375813084496.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
